The intent of the ensuing construction is to permit certain accounts to be amalgamated
by combining their balance and transaction entries. The starting point for the quotient
construction is an equivalence relation, E, on the set A, i.e., a binary relation on A
which is reflexive, symmetric and transitive. The relation E can always be thought of
