Im Θ = (Θ(A)|Θ*(T)|Θ*(B)). Thus, the accounts, transactions and balances of Im Θ
are those inherited from A . Observe that Im Θ is a sub-accounting system of A* in
the sense of section 4.

Theorem. Let Θ : A → A* be a homomorphism of accounting systems arising from
a function Θ : A → A*. Let EΘ denote the relation on A in which ai EΘ aj if and only if
